WEBVTT

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:37.000
Yes, Special Investigation Division.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:37.460
Sir!

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:43.840
I just got a call from the factory.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:46.790
98 Petraver AV-type 3 units

00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:48.690
are loaded with Dongsu-dong-type trailers.

00:00:49.450 --> 00:00:52.070
They left the factory at 7 a.m. today.

00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:54.650
The arrival time is 11 a.m.

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:55.130
Okay.

00:00:55.710 --> 00:00:56.090
Sir.

00:00:56.910 --> 00:00:57.840
What is it?

00:00:57.880 --> 00:00:58.970
They're finally coming.

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:00.810
The new Naver.

00:01:01.130 --> 00:01:02.350
So what?

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:06.620
What do you mean, what do you mean?

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:07.200
I'm just saying that I'm so happy.

00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:10.840
The high-tech transfer unit of the police station

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:13.060
and the future police chief are talking about it.

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:15.280
In reality, what's the budget?

00:01:15.640 --> 00:01:16.060
What's the plan?

00:01:16.660 --> 00:01:18.620
These changes are being judged every day.

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:21.030
At least, the Naver that was given to us

00:01:21.030 --> 00:01:22.210
is a 90-year-old Dalrang 3D

00:01:22.210 --> 00:01:23.870
that has only police marks on it.

00:01:25.050 --> 00:01:27.020
It's been three months since our special department was established,

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:29.760
but during that time, the police's trash...

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:34.540
You know how sad it was for our members to get paid for their hard work.

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:40.490
But now, we're going to face the new generation of ravers.

00:01:40.670 --> 00:01:42.450
The history of that pain is over.

00:01:43.090 --> 00:01:46.220
We're going to be honored to be the apostles of justice in this era.

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:49.320
We're going to be reborn as a true pet raver unit.

00:01:51.390 --> 00:01:56.720
Mansu, when I was 12 years old, I picked up a high-end motorcycle.

00:01:57.360 --> 00:01:58.840
I was beaten by my father a lot.

00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:04.450
Since then, for 50 years, I've only lived without a machine.

00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:08.110
What glory do I want now?

00:02:08.110 --> 00:02:11.900
But a new machine.

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:17.010
Now I want to see the machine born in the world with my own eyes.

00:02:17.250 --> 00:02:19.510
I want to touch it. I want to open it.

00:02:20.130 --> 00:02:23.080
It's been only a year, and I've been waiting here since the morning.

00:02:25.390 --> 00:02:26.430
Machine light.

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:29.460
It's like the old man's nonsense that's fallen behind the times.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.000
Thank you for watching.

00:02:36.588 --> 00:02:37.088
Huh?

00:02:37.452 --> 00:02:38.732
It's a real car.

00:02:39.404 --> 00:02:40.684
What's going on at this time?

00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:00.000
I've seen it a lot in the movies.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:00.320
Don't you think it's the right place?

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:02.300
Women can't even look at the shadows.

00:03:02.440 --> 00:03:04.040
All the employees are like gangsters.

00:03:04.480 --> 00:03:05.400
Drinking and playing.

00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:07.640
The most painful thing is that you have to fight and fight

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:09.520
to feel the friendship of a man.

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:11.240
Strange groups are depressed.

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:12.780
Wasn't that a military movie?

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:15.270
There must be a class. There must be a cannon.

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:16.210
What's different from the army?

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:20.080
Anyway, this is an hour away from Seoul.

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:21.780
I can't believe it.

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:24.320
If you want to run away, you have to do it now.

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:26.990
If you want to run away, go ahead.

00:03:26.990 --> 00:03:28.540
I'm going to kill you right here with Dal-jju's current crime.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.360
What kind of army is this?

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:34.360
Hey, new recruits.

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:37.240
This way, this way.

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:39.720
Take the command post and go to the director's office.

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:41.610
Oh, I got caught.

00:03:41.970 --> 00:03:42.870
Come on, let's go.

00:03:42.990 --> 00:03:43.230
Run.

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:44.520
Hello.

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:49.750
Oh, no.

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:51.230
I think the members came first.

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:52.810
I don't know if there's anyone to use.

00:03:54.010 --> 00:03:55.460
I'll send it to you.

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:58.400
We beat Ilso, who is the strongest in labor.

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:00.690
I'm worried because I'm going to be on the latest Naver.

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:06.900
That's the problem. It depends on the decision of the main office.

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:09.120
Including the selection of those five people.

00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:13.580
Five people? That's not enough.

00:04:13.760 --> 00:04:19.750
Look! This is the area where ordinary people are not allowed to track!

00:04:20.470 --> 00:04:23.490
If you play here, you'll be arrested by us.

00:04:23.790 --> 00:04:24.290
Report!

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:28.880
Oh Hyeri and Soonkyung are now in charge of the police department.

00:04:30.190 --> 00:04:31.790
I am reporting this as the second batch of the second batch of the first batch of the first batch of the second batch.

00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:34.830
