00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:40.010
No. 1, pilot Oh Yu-ri.

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:41.080
Yes sir!

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:42.840
Commander Baek Jung-woo.

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:45.420
