00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:10.660
If you're going to practice with a gun like that, you have to use a military shooting range.

00:08:11.660 --> 00:08:15.270
I mean, it's full of military use plans until this month.

00:08:16.170 --> 00:08:21.940
Then I heard that the raver competition is usually allowed to have a three-round magazine, but even that...

00:08:21.940 --> 00:08:22.560
Oh, attitude.

