It doesn't work except for training once a year.

00:08:33.040 --> 00:08:35.840
That's why you can't complete the mission properly when you're in a real emergency.

00:08:37.060 --> 00:08:38.480
Taedo, stop it now.

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:40.290
