G, H, J, L, M, second step, all clear.

00:15:45.550 --> 00:15:45.870
Start!

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:47.440
Are you sure you're okay?

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:48.740
I can't do anything!

00:15:49.740 --> 00:15:51.040
Well, hurry up and start!

00:16:34.570 --> 00:16:36.580
Run! Run!

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:37.400
Hello?

00:16:41.340 --> 00:16:42.850
What do you mean, hello?

00:16:43.310 --> 00:16:44.300
How is the situation?

00:16:44.720 --> 00:16:46.680
Ah! All of the troops have been launched.

00:16:47.260 --> 00:16:49.070
From now on, the number of works...

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:49.370
Ah!

00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:53.540
...to all vehicles.

00:16:54.020 --> 00:16:57.140
The target is currently landing at Banpo Bridge and moving in the direction of Banpo.

00:16:57.300 --> 00:16:59.270
Daehan Middle School 98...

00:17:00.090 --> 00:17:01.270
It was found to be a labor P.K.L.

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:08.310
The purpose is to terrorize the main buildings in Gangnam, but the details are unknown.

00:17:09.360 --> 00:17:10.520
Yeongdo is a bus terminal.

00:17:10.740 --> 00:17:11.660
Jeongwon, wait near the flower market.

00:17:12.540 --> 00:17:16.590
We have to drag the criminal to Wumyeon Mountain so that he can't enter the city alone.

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:21.020
Captain, can't we just solve it with a full attack near the terminal?

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:21.920
No.

00:17:22.440 --> 00:17:23.280
Huh? Why?

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:26.130
There are a lot of people there, and I was born there.

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:29.730
Is the labor being recovered?

00:17:30.990 --> 00:17:31.570
Did you hear that, Hidechi?

00:17:32.790 --> 00:17:35.880
We've successfully recovered the second car, but the first car is a bit...

00:17:36.420 --> 00:17:39.610
What happened to the first car? What are you dreaming about?

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:40.070
No!

00:18:01.530 --> 00:18:02.430
We are moving to the terminal from the front.

00:18:02.530 --> 00:18:04.500
We are moving to the terminal from the front.

00:18:09.770 --> 00:18:11.330
Terminal and the terminal are sealed off.

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:14.080
The B company will support the C company and guard the entrance to Wumyeongsan Park.

00:18:15.120 --> 00:18:16.440
We have evacuated all the citizens in the area.

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:18.950
Yes, you did a good job.

00:18:19.290 --> 00:18:29.760
The snow is blooming. The flowers are blooming in the summer.

00:18:32.970 --> 00:18:33.110
Good.

00:18:41.740 --> 00:18:42.900
Finally, all the actors are here.

00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:46.200
Now, let's get started.

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:49.610
Each car, report the current situation.

00:18:50.990 --> 00:18:51.610
This is the terminal.

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:52.730
The second car has been placed.

00:18:53.350 --> 00:18:54.530
This is the first car.

00:18:55.210 --> 00:18:56.010
The initial setting is complete.

00:18:56.150 --> 00:18:57.090
It's just been placed.

00:18:57.610 --> 00:18:58.440
All right.

00:18:58.600 --> 00:18:59.640
Fortunately, it's not late.

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:07.980
Don't worry. Even if it's the same product, it's much stronger on our side.

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:11.210
I'm not worried, so don't worry. I believe in Alphonse.

00:19:11.610 --> 00:19:12.330
I agree.

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:29.970
Come on, come on, come on, come on, come on, come on, come on, come on, come on, come on, come on, come on, come on, come on, come on, come on, come on.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:31.440
I can't even go one step further.

00:19:31.920 --> 00:19:33.180
What are you talking about?

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:34.670
Why don't you just let me go?

00:19:34.670 --> 00:19:36.390
Instead of stopping me from going to the other side,

00:19:36.910 --> 00:19:37.690
it's our job to make you go to the circular road.

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:40.350
Shut up!

00:19:41.440 --> 00:19:42.340
What's there to wait for?

00:19:42.940 --> 00:19:45.240
We can just make a bee house here.

00:19:45.620 --> 00:19:46.500
I'm here! I'm here!

00:19:46.680 --> 00:19:49.320
300, 250, 200, 150!

00:19:50.220 --> 00:19:52.120
Do your best, bastard!

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:05.610
Ah, my neck...

00:20:05.670 --> 00:20:15.160
The police car was in front of us?

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:17.240
The kid's neck fell off?

00:20:17.540 --> 00:20:17.840
What?

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:20.430
How dare you

00:20:20.430 --> 00:20:21.020
attack the police?

00:20:21.740 --> 00:20:22.060
Yuri!

00:20:22.940 --> 00:20:23.730
Even if you were a little stupid,

00:20:24.090 --> 00:20:24.950
you were our colleague!

00:20:25.230 --> 00:20:25.800
You have to pay for the enemy!

00:20:26.460 --> 00:20:27.400
I can't!

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:29.290
How am I supposed to fight a guy like that?

00:20:30.760 --> 00:20:31.160
Get ready to be fired!

00:21:02.390 --> 00:21:12.220
This is the No.1 car! The target is heading towards the circular road as planned!

00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:13.720
We'll start the chase!

00:21:15.550 --> 00:21:16.640
Yuri! Yuri, what are you doing?

00:21:17.320 --> 00:21:22.490
I want to use this car!

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:29.660
What are you going to do? We're going to chase you!

00:21:32.460 --> 00:21:34.320
Show the monster the hot taste of justice!

00:22:08.280 --> 00:22:11.140
Ugh, I can't believe gas is falling in a place like this.

00:22:11.320 --> 00:22:13.940
The police around us are making a fuss. Let's go!

00:22:14.200 --> 00:22:14.500
Hey!

00:22:14.730 --> 00:22:17.900
We are completely exposed now!

00:22:18.020 --> 00:22:19.260
Drop your weapons and escape!

00:22:30.190 --> 00:22:30.870
I knew it.

00:22:31.090 --> 00:22:32.980
This is different from the toys other people use.

00:22:33.940 --> 00:22:34.800
It's a missile that can destroy real tanks.

00:22:36.180 --> 00:22:38.820
I'm going to use this as a museum

00:22:38.820 --> 00:22:39.900
and shoot it with a single shot.

00:22:39.940 --> 00:22:42.380
I told you not to use it like that.

00:22:42.780 --> 00:22:43.940
What are you going to do now?

00:22:44.520 --> 00:22:45.920
Well, you'll have to wait and see.

00:22:46.240 --> 00:22:46.780
Listen up!

00:22:47.140 --> 00:22:49.960
If you don't bring us the car and food

00:22:49.960 --> 00:22:51.760
and the 10 million won in cash

00:22:51.760 --> 00:22:53.620
to the 1,000 won bank account within 5 minutes...

00:22:54.130 --> 00:22:54.720
I'll kill you!

00:23:00.440 --> 00:23:01.380
If you don't find it, I'll shoot you!

00:23:02.200 --> 00:23:04.270
You son of a bitch!

00:23:04.370 --> 00:23:27.100
I've been waiting all day, and now I'm here.

00:23:27.560 --> 00:23:29.510
One has no neck, one has no arm.

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:34.060
But you can fix it, right?

00:23:34.560 --> 00:23:35.520
I can fix it.

00:23:35.940 --> 00:23:39.440
Thank you, boss.

00:23:39.920 --> 00:23:40.820
Mansoo, Bench.

00:23:40.980 --> 00:23:41.200
Yes.

00:23:41.520 --> 00:23:46.320
But our power is much stronger?

00:23:46.700 --> 00:23:47.960
Did I say that?

00:23:48.700 --> 00:23:49.520
I did.

00:23:50.390 --> 00:23:52.230
Then the problem must have been the difference in skills.

00:23:52.690 --> 00:23:54.780
I won against a three-year-old guy.

00:23:56.000 --> 00:23:56.920
Wasn't that a bridge?

00:24:07.932 --> 00:24:09.932
I'm sorry for calling you out for a break.

00:24:10.460 --> 00:24:11.920
Thanks to that, the work was done well.

00:24:12.508 --> 00:24:15.108
You don't have to be sorry about this.

00:24:15.868 --> 00:24:20.248
And I don't know what the people up there are thinking.

00:24:20.796 --> 00:24:25.556
If we had invited that new labor, it would have been more efficient than it is now.

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:30.120
Do you want to take it?

00:24:30.500 --> 00:24:30.900
What?

00:24:32.030 --> 00:24:32.370
That...

00:24:32.370 --> 00:24:33.870
New Lava

00:24:33.870 --> 00:24:38.080
I want to take it.

00:24:41.530 --> 00:24:42.350
What do you want?

00:25:05.180 --> 00:25:06.560
Right before the New York market is closed,

00:25:06.588 --> 00:25:08.108
The movement of the terrorist organization is suspicious.

00:25:08.348 --> 00:25:10.588
Suddenly, Captain Yu Hyeon-yang appeared in the special medical department.

00:25:10.684 --> 00:25:12.724
What is the information she brought?

00:25:12.828 --> 00:25:14.268
I feel so sorry for Jungwoo!

00:25:14.268 --> 00:25:16.268
Next story, Eliminate the bomb!

00:25:16.508 --> 00:25:17.508
Please look forward to it!
